:: RobinTemple Clasp
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<set $RobinTemple.clasp_discussed to true>>
<!-- 罗宾线自行解释誓言与器具的关系，因此这里让约旦保持原版那种回避、克制的口吻。 -->
<<if $RobinTemple.stage is 'promised'>>
  <<if $RobinTemple.clasp_equipped>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        Robin touches the chastity belt when you ask about it. "Jordan let me choose whether to wear it after our promise," <<he>> says. "I want to be able to change that choice honestly."
      <<option 'CN'>>
        你问起贞操带，罗宾碰了碰扣锁。“立誓之后，约旦让我自己决定戴不戴，”<<he>>说，“如果想改变主意，我也希望能坦白说出来。”
    <</language>>
  <<elseif C.npc.Robin.chastity.anus is ''
    and C.npc.Robin.chastity.vagina is ''
    and C.npc.Robin.chastity.penis is ''>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        Robin puts down the storeroom list. The chastity belt lies in <<his>> bag now. "Our promise still stands," <<he>> says, "whether I choose to wear it or not."
      <<option 'CN'>>
        罗宾放下储藏室清单。贞操带现在收在<<his>>的包里。“我们的承诺还在，”<<he>>说，“戴不戴它，都不会改变这件事。”
    <</language>>
  <<else>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        Robin puts down the storeroom list. The fitting <<he>> wears is not the temple's. Jordan cannot change another person's lock.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        罗宾放下储藏室清单。<<He>>身上的器具并非神殿所有。约旦不能擅自更动别人的东西。
    <</language>>
  <</if>>
<<elseif C.npc.Robin.revelationConviction gte 120>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Robin closes the storeroom list when you ask about the chastity belt. <<He>> does not want to leave the temple. He only wants to know whether he can put a promise into his own words, belt or no belt.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你问起贞操带，罗宾合上储藏室清单。<<He>>并不想离开神殿，只想知道除了这件器具之外，能不能用自己的话再立一次承诺。
  <</language>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Robin closes the storeroom list. "I still need time to decide what I believe," <<he>> says. "I like the quiet here. I am not ready to promise my whole life to it yet."
    <<option 'CN'>>
      罗宾合上储藏室清单。“我还得想清楚自己相信什么，”<<he>>说，“我喜欢这里的安静，可还没准备好把一生都许给它。”
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if $RobinTemple.stage is 'promised'>>
  <<if $RobinTemple.clasp_request isnot ''>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        Robin has already spoken to Jordan. <<He>> will tell you what they decided tomorrow.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        罗宾已经去找过约旦。明天<<he>>会告诉你，他们商量出了什么结果。
    <</language>>
    <br><br>
  <<elseif $RobinTemple.clasp_equipped
    and C.npc.Robin.chastity.anus is 'anal shield'
    and C.npc.Robin.chastity.vagina is 'chastity belt'
    and C.npc.Robin.chastity.penis is 'chastity belt'>>
    <<lockicon 'unlock'>><<lanLink '问罗宾是否想取下贞操带 (0:15)' 'RobinTemple Clasp Request'>>
      <<set $RobinTemple.clasp_request to 'remove'>>
      <<set $RobinTemple.clasp_request_day to Time.days>>
      <<pass 15>>
    <</lanLink>><br>
  <<elseif !$RobinTemple.clasp_equipped
    and C.npc.Robin.chastity.anus is ''
    and C.npc.Robin.chastity.vagina is ''
    and C.npc.Robin.chastity.penis is ''>>
    <<lockicon>><<lanLink '问罗宾是否想重新戴上贞操带 (0:15)' 'RobinTemple Clasp Request'>>
      <<set $RobinTemple.clasp_request to 'refit'>>
      <<set $RobinTemple.clasp_request_day to Time.days>>
      <<pass 15>>
    <</lanLink>><br>
  <<else>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        Robin is wearing a different fitting. <<He>> will need to discuss that one with its owner before changing anything.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        罗宾身上是另一套装置。改动之前，<<he>>得先与那套装置的主人商量。
    <</language>>
    <br><br>
  <</if>>
<<else>>
  <<socialiseicon 'ask'>><<lanLink '请罗宾亲自向约旦询问' 'RobinTemple Clasp Jordan'>><</lanLink>><br>
<</if>>
<<loveicon 'hug'>><<lanLink '先听罗宾说完' 'RobinTemple Clasp Listen'>><</lanLink>><br>

:: RobinTemple Clasp Request
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<if $RobinTemple.stage is 'promised'
  and $RobinTemple.clasp_request_day is Time.days>>
  <<if $RobinTemple.clasp_request is 'remove'>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        "Do you want to ask Jordan about taking the lock off?" you say. Robin looks down at the clasp, then nods. "I want to explain it myself," <<he>> says. "Wait until tomorrow, and I'll tell you what Jordan said."
      <<option 'CN'>>
        “你想不想去问约旦，能不能取下贞操带？”你问。罗宾低头看了看扣锁，点点头。“我想自己说明白，”<<he>>说，“等明天，我再告诉你约旦怎么说。”
    <</language>>
  <<else>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        You ask whether Robin wants to wear the chastity belt again. <<He>> thinks for a moment. "I might," <<he>> says. "But I will speak to Jordan myself before deciding."
      <<option 'CN'>>
        你问罗宾是否想重新戴上贞操带。<<He>>想了一会儿。“也许想，”<<he>>说，“但我会先亲自与约旦谈，再作决定。”
    <</language>>
  <</if>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      There is nothing to arrange right now.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      现在没有需要商量的事。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<icon 'temple/Robinquarters.png'>><<lanLink '回到罗宾的座位' 'RobinTemple Corner'>><</lanLink>><br>

:: RobinTemple Clasp Result
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<if $RobinTemple.stage is 'promised'
  and $RobinTemple.clasp_request isnot ''
  and Time.days gt $RobinTemple.clasp_request_day>>
  <<if $RobinTemple.clasp_request is 'remove'
    and $RobinTemple.clasp_equipped
    and C.npc.Robin.chastity.anus is 'anal shield'
    and C.npc.Robin.chastity.vagina is 'chastity belt'
    and C.npc.Robin.chastity.penis is 'chastity belt'>>
    <<set C.npc.Robin.chastity.anus to ''>>
    <<set C.npc.Robin.chastity.vagina to ''>>
    <<set C.npc.Robin.chastity.penis to ''>>
    <<set $RobinTemple.clasp_equipped to false>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        Robin meets you outside the side room. The belt is open in <<his>> hands. "Jordan heard me out," <<he>> says, "and did not make the decision for me. I asked for it to come off. Our promise stays either way."
      <<option 'CN'>>
        罗宾在侧室外等你，手里拿着打开的贞操带。“约旦听我说完了，”<<he>>说，“没有替我拿主意。是我自己要求取下的。取不取，承诺都在。”
    <</language>>
    <br><br>
    <span class='green'><<lanSwitch 'Robin asked for the belt to be removed.' '罗宾自己要求取下了贞操带。'>></span>
  <<elseif $RobinTemple.clasp_request is 'refit'
    and !$RobinTemple.clasp_equipped
    and C.npc.Robin.chastity.anus is ''
    and C.npc.Robin.chastity.vagina is ''
    and C.npc.Robin.chastity.penis is ''>>
    <<set C.npc.Robin.chastity.anus to 'anal shield'>>
    <<set C.npc.Robin.chastity.vagina to 'chastity belt'>>
    <<set C.npc.Robin.chastity.penis to 'chastity belt'>>
    <<set $RobinTemple.clasp_equipped to true>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        Robin comes back from speaking to Jordan with the belt fastened again. "It was my own request," <<he>> says. "I know I can ask to change my mind." <<He>> takes your hand before returning to the work list.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        罗宾与约旦谈过之后，重新戴好了贞操带。“是我自己要求的，”<<he>>说，“我也知道，将来还可以再改主意。”<<He>>牵了牵你的手，才回到工作表前。
    <</language>>
    <br><br>
    <span class='green'><<lanSwitch 'Robin asked for the belt to be refitted.' '罗宾自己要求重新戴上了贞操带。'>></span>
  <<else>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        Jordan finds a different fitting in place and leaves it untouched. Robin agrees that changing it must be discussed separately.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        约旦发现罗宾身上已有另一套装置，没有擅自更动。罗宾也同意，这件事需要另外商量。
    <</language>>
  <</if>>
  <<set $RobinTemple.clasp_request to ''>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Robin has no news from Jordan yet.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      罗宾还没收到约旦的答复。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<icon 'temple/Robinquarters.png'>><<lanLink '回到罗宾的座位' 'RobinTemple Corner'>><</lanLink>><br>

:: RobinTemple Clasp Jordan
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    Robin speaks first when Jordan arrives. Jordan says the belt is the temple's, and that the temple cannot release another person's. "Ask the one who holds it," Jordan says. "You may also decide not to."
  <<option 'CN'>>
    约旦来后，罗宾先开口。约旦说，这条贞操带属于神殿，神殿不能替别人解开。至于钥匙在谁手里，得去问那个人。“你可以去问，”约旦说，“也可以选择不问。”
<</language>>
<br><br>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    Robin asks what would happen if the two of you made a promise together. Jordan asks to see your work records before giving an answer.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    罗宾问，如果你们共同立誓会怎样。约旦想先看你们的工作记录，再作回答。
<</language>>
<<set C.npc.Robin.revelationConviction to Math.min(200, C.npc.Robin.revelationConviction + 3)>>
<<npcincr Robin dom 1>><br><br><<gdom>>
<<templeicon 'altar'>><<lanLink '谈谈共同立誓' 'RobinTemple Promise Talk'>><</lanLink>><br>
<<icon 'temple/Robinquarters.png'>><<lanLink '回到罗宾的座位' 'RobinTemple Corner'>><</lanLink>><br>

:: RobinTemple Clasp Listen
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You leave the list untouched and let Robin find <<his>> words. <<He>> tells you which parts of the work matter to <<him>>, and which rules still frighten <<him>>.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你没有碰那张清单，等罗宾自己把话说完。<<He>>告诉你，哪些工作对<<him>>重要，哪些规矩仍让<<him>>害怕。
<</language>>
<br><br>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    "I can ask Jordan myself," <<he>> says at last. "I just wanted you to know first."
  <<option 'CN'>>
    “我能自己去问约旦，”<<he>>最后说，“只是想先告诉你。”
<</language>>
<<npcincr Robin love 2>><<npcincr Robin trauma -2>><br><br><<glove>><<lrtrauma>>
<<icon 'temple/Robinquarters.png'>><<lanLink '回到罗宾的座位' 'RobinTemple Corner'>><</lanLink>><br>
